  maxGhostRecordings: 1
  twoGhostLine: 
  fragmentsCompleteLine: "Th\u1EBB ca n\xE0y mang t\xEAn anh. T\xF4i \u0111\xE3 x\xF3a
    n\xF3 m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n r\u1ED3i."
  fragments:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7dbe28f3062ce114fa4a31e6dcd4a088, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 746ff8cc20f34634fb4e5dab9eea7b0f, type: 2}
  solution: "1) Nh\u1EB7t th\xF9ng \u1EDF G3 (l\xE0n g\u1EA7n, E).\n2) \u0110\u1ED5i
    sang l\xE0n xa (W), \u0111\u1EE9ng \u1EDF G5,6 v\xE0 \u0111\u1EB7t th\xF9ng (E)
    l\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA1p t\u1EA3i G6 \u2014 c\u1EA7u n\xE2ng h\u1EA1 xu\u1ED1ng.\n3)
    V\u1EC1 l\xE0n g\u1EA7n (S), \u0111i qua c\u1EA7u G10\u2013G14. L\xE0n xa b\u1ECB
    container ch\u1EB7n t\u1EDBi G11,5.\n4) N\u1EBFu NH\u1ECAP \u0111\xE3 l\xEAn
    b\u1EADc 2 (v\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECF \u1EDF G12,5): qua kh\u1ECFi G11,6 th\xEC \u0111\u1ED5i
    sang l\xE0n c\xF2n l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 n\xE9 m\xF3c c\u1EA9u.\n5) T\u1EDBi
    th\xF9ng th\u01B0 G16.\n6) (v3.1) B\xE3i container G16\u2013G20: l\xE0n xa b\u1ECB
    container ch\u1EAFn t\u1EDBi G18. \u0110i l\xE0n g\u1EA7n, Space \u0111\u1EC3
    nh\u1EA3y qua \u0111\u1ED1ng th\xF9ng th\u1EA5p \u1EDF G17. Qua G18: n\u1EBFu
    v\xF2ng \u0111\u1ECF \u1EDF l\xE0n g\u1EA7n th\xEC \u0111\u1ED5i sang l\xE0n
    xa \u0111\u1EC3 n\xE9 m\xF3c c\u1EA9u G18,7. T\u1EDBi th\xF9ng th\u01B0 cu\u1ED1i
    G19,6.\nM\u1EA3nh nh\u1EDB: th\u1EBB ca c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ti\u1EC1n nhi\u1EC7m
    (G7,4 l\xE0n xa, khu b\u1EBFn h\xE0ng), nh\u1EADt k\xFD c\u1EA7n c\u1EA9u (G12,3
    l\xE0n xa, d\u01B0\u1EDBi c\u1EA7n c\u1EA9u)."
